      "side": 1,
      "message": "That was a suggestion from @ptosi@google.com, I think, unless I\u0027ve garbled it.\n\nThere was also a question from him about whether it should be a DT rather than a DTBO - and also whether we should pick a better name than \"VM base DTBO\". Reference DT?",
